intlimiter (1.1.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Hardened state handling and deterministic IFB behavior
  * Fixed state load/clear behavior under concurrent or partial state
  * Added dependency check for ip, tc, bc, sudo before applying limits
  * Added filesystem lock for state mutations with optional disable via
    INTLIMITER_STATE_LOCK=0
  * Improved --clear to directly teardown qdiscs and IFB instead of
    relying only on saved state

 -- Hermes Agent <noreply@example.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000

intlimiter (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Limit download/upload speeds independently
  * Support for mbit and mbyte units
  * Auto network interface detection

